{"id":"92bf09d894f8282f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md","title":"Prime Ideal","display":"df-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-prime-ideal","aliases":["58-df-prime-ideal"],"display":"df-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-prime-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-prime-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-ideal — Prime Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))\\)</span>（幂集格上的集合理想谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（此处定义的 prime set-ideal 谓词）</li>\n<li>交集是布尔代数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> 中的 meet</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(\\mathcal I,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\;(X\\cap Y\\in\\mathcal I\\to X\\in\\mathcal I\\lor Y\\in\\mathcal I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(\\mathcal I,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\;(X\\cap Y\\in\\mathcal I\\to X\\in\\mathcal I\\lor Y\\in\\mathcal I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子定义的是幂集布尔代数上的 prime ideal，不是交换环中的素理想；载体必须是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>，而顶元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))$（幂集格上的集合理想谓词，见 [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(\\mathcal I,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(A))\\land A\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\;(X\\cap Y\\in\\mathcal I\\to X\\in\\mathcal I\\lor Y\\in\\mathcal I)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":995,"backlinks":[{"id":"5ef8327905835e84","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeIdeal}(P,A)$ (prime ideal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-prime-ideal]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-982","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-prime-ideal.md|58-df-prime-ideal]]（batch17）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-def-operator.md]]\n[[58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-df-p-name.md]]\n[[58-df-aleph.md]]\n[[58-df-antichain.md]]\n[[58-df-baire-property.md]]\n[[58-df-beth-function.md]]\n[[58-df-bijective.md]]\n[[58-df-borel.md]]\n[[58-df-bounded.md]]\n[[58-df-branch.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinal.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinaladd.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalclass.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalmul.md]]\n[[58-df-cartesian.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchy.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchyseq.md]]\n[[58-df-ch.md]]\n[[58-df-chain.md]]\n[[58-df-closed.md]]\n[[58-df-club-filter.md]]\n[[58-df-club.md]]\n[[58-df-cofinality.md]]\n[[58-df-compatible.md]]\n[[58-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[58-df-continuous.md]]\n[[58-df-continuum.md]]\n[[58-df-countable.md]]\n[[58-df-critical-point.md]]\n[[58-df-ctm.md]]\n[[58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]\n[[58-df-dense.md]]\n[[58-df-diamond.md]]\n[[58-df-diff.md]]\n[[58-df-disjoint.md]]\n[[58-df-domain.md]]\n[[58-df-dual-ideal.md]]\n[[58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]\n[[58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[58-df-emptyset.md]]\n[[58-df-epsilon0.md]]\n[[58-df-epsilonnumber.md]]\n[[58-df-equinumerous.md]]\n[[58-df-equivalence.md]]\n[[58-df-equivalenceclass.md]]\n[[58-df-filter-set.md]]\n[[58-df-filte